    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "In the future world, the virtual game \"Annogus\" developed by Chu's Group has attracted the world's attention because of its perfect immersive experience, but on the eve of the game's official launch, the game developers Chu's couple mysteriously disappeared. In order to find the whereabouts of his parents, Kuo Shao Chu Yi entered the game upgrade adventure with 30 billion krypton gold under the guidance of the humanoid AI Kaos. In the process, Chu Yi gathered a group of fellow players who fought side by side, and after several efforts, it was finally found out that the disappearance of his parents was related to the Phantom World Organization. In order to find the whereabouts of his parents, fight against the Phantom World Organization, and \"save\" the world of the Era, Chu Yi launched a series of ridiculous and unimaginable Krypton operations, and embarked on a heroic journey of pretending to be a pig and eating a tiger, and a wonderful battle between good and evil began.",
        "jpn": null
    },
